	<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Label to identify an event associated with the collection of the biospecimen (e.g. Baseline, End of Treatment, Overall survival, Final). Use Biospecimen Timepoint Offset to indicate the number of post-event days that elapsed before the biospecimen was collected. NO PHI/PII INFORMATION IS ALLOWED.";
