<http://syn.org/mc2/tool_view/tool_package_dependencies> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Tool Package Dependencies";
	<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "Specifies the software libraries, frameworks, or other components that a tool or package relies on for its proper functioning. This attribute helps users understand the prerequisites needed for installation and usage of the tool within a given computational environment";
